2 NOTE Google Translation: I well remember Aunt Margit. She was the grandmother's sister. When it was skiing, she went past us on Opsund to the golf course. She had always wearing skirts and anorak. Ski Binding went far up the boots and 
3 CONC poles were too long so she was always far below the rods. We kids thought this was a little embarrassing, she attracted the attention as she went, but she was a very friendly old dame.De other characters I've NOK met occasionally,
3 CONC  but remember no other name than Sigurd. 
2 NOTE Jeg husker godt tante  Margit .Hun var farmors søster. Når det var skiføre gikk hun forbi oss på Opsund til Golfbanen. Hun hadde altid på seg skjørt og anorakk. Skibindingene gikk langt oppover støvlene og stavene var altfor lange
3 CONC  så hun holdt alltid langt nede på stavene. Vi ungene syntes dette var litt flaut hun vakte jo litt oppmerksomhet der hun gikk, men hun var en veldig vennlig gammel dame.De andre personene har jeg nok møtt ved noen anledninger, me
3 CONC n husker ingen andre navn enn Sigurd.
