0 @I6000000019118381321@ INDI
1 NAME Mikaela Pauline /Shiffrin/
2 GIVN Mikaela Pauline
2 SURN Shiffrin
1 NAME Mikaela Shiffrin
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 13 MAR 1995
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vail
3 STAE Colorado
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU Alpine Skier
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Mikaela Shiffrin''' is an American alpine skier. She has the most alpine ski World Cup wins of any alpine skier in history (men or women) and is the only one to have reached the milestone of 100 victories. She i
2 CONC s a three-time Olympic gold medalist, a five-time World Cup champion, a four-time world champion in slalom, and a nine-time winner of the World Cup discipline title in that event. Shiffrin, at 18 years and 345 days, became the you
2 CONC ngest slalom gold medalist in Olympic history in 2014. Shiffrin is widely considered one of the greatest alpine skiers in history.
2 CONT
2 CONT Shiffrin won her eighth career Alpine world championships gold medal on February 11, 2025, taking her overall tally to 15 medals from 18 career world championship races, and making Shiffrin the most successful skier in the modern 
2 CONC era She was named one of the 100 most influential people in the world by ''Time'' magazine in 2023.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family life===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Vail, Colorado, Shiffrin is the second child of Eileen (née Condron) and Jeff Shiffrin, both originally from the Northeastern United States and former ski racers, her mother became a nationally prominent masters racer. Her
2 CONC  paternal grandfather was Jewish. Shiffrin's father Jeff grew up in New Jersey and was an avid skier on weekends in Vermont with his family. As an undergraduate, he raced for Dartmouth College in New Hampshire. Her mother Eileen r
2 CONC aced in high school in northwestern Massachusetts in the Berkshires, and her brother Taylor (born 1992) raced for the University of Denver.
2 CONT
2 CONT Since 2021, Shiffrin has been in a relationship with the Norwegian World Cup alpine ski racer Aleksander Aamodt Kilde. On April 4, 2024, the couple announced their engagement. ''(Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0)''
2 CONT
